+// (STATUS_CANCELLED) when its socket, or AcceptEx's accepting socket, is
+// closed. Its OVERLAPPED gets the status and byte count, its event (if any)
+// is set and, unless the event's low bit is set, a packet with the status
+// goes to the port. Its buffer is written only while it is pending, under
